<main><section class="hero" id="home"><div class="shape burst"></div><div class="shape ring"></div><div class="shape dot"></div><div class="hero-type"><span class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO MY CREATIVE UNIVERSE</span><h1>MY<br><span>WORLD.</span></h1><p>いくつもの物語と、たくさんの登場人物たち。<br>ここは、すべての創作世界への入口。</p></div><div class="stage" id="stage"><div class="layer" data-layer="0"><div class="placeholder" style="--bg:#f7b3cc"></div></div><div class="layer" data-layer="1"><div class="placeholder" style="--bg:#9fcae2"></div></div><div class="layer" data-layer="2"><div class="placeholder" style="--bg:#f6e78e"></div></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><a class="pill" href="#works">EXPLORE WORKS <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="scroll">SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</div></section>
